[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_02]
Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_02_desc]
Derpy Hooves suddenly has an idea to find the Las Pegasus Lab to conduct research on muffins, but she doesn’t know where the Las Pegasus Lab is.

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_02_TOOLTIP]
Derpy Hooves is thinking about muffins, but what exactly she is thinking about, we will never know.

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_02]
马芬！

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_02_desc]
呆蹄突发奇想，想要找洛马基实验室开展一项新的研究，关于马芬的研究，但是她不知道洛马基实验室在哪里。

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_02_TOOLTIP]
呆蹄在思考关于马芬的问题，但是她究竟在想什么，我们永远不会知道。

